 24\n\nJoin us for a festive evening of music and merriment as The 'Quin ce
 lebrates Back Bay's annual Commonwealth Avenue Tree Lighting together wi
 th the community. From our front steps\, enjoy complimentary cookies\, hot
  cocoa\, and a live outdoor performance by members of the Harvard Krokodil
 oes\, while you gather together with the neighborhood to watch the entire 
 block illuminate.\n\nWe encourage participating members to contribute to T
 he 'Quin Impact Fund's annual Wonderfund Toy Drive\, supporting children
  served by the DCF. Please bring an unwrapped toy from the Wonderfund Amaz
 on Wishlist to be collected in the Lobby on this evening by a member of Th
 e 'Quin Impact Fund team.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for
  members only. Complimentary light bites and refreshments will be served.
