 tatus: futureSale\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/2133
 44\n\nCelebrate Hanukkah with an intimate and uplifting gathering in The R
 eading Room. Rabbi Mayer Zarchi will join members to light the menorah a
 nd begin the holiday with reflection and warmth. A pianist and vocalist wi
 ll provide gentle background music throughout the evening\, adding to the 
 glow of the occasion.\n\nA selection of traditional bites will be offered\
 , including potato latkes topped with smoked trout roe\, crème fraîche\,
  and chives\; Honeycrisp apple butter latkes\; and sufganiyot doughnut hol
 es filled with berry jam. A selection of kosher wines will also be served.
