SUMMARY:Art Tour: How The 'Quin Collection Came Together
LOCATION:Meet in The Lobby
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211942\n\nKate Chertavian Fine
  Art's curation of the 'Quin sought to broaden the Algonquin Club's histor
 ic collection by introducing a talented group of artists who have local\, 
 national\, and international stories and backgrounds. Please join 'Quin Ho
 use curator Kate Chertavian for an art tour focused on the curatorial proc
 ess of building the 'Quin's collection. The discussion will include insigh
 ts into the collaborative process of selection\, placement\, and installat
 ion of these artworks which have come to define the spirit of the club. Th
 e tour will begin in the Lobby and continue through the Grand Staircase an
 d Reading Room\, highlighting key works and the stories behind them. \n\n*
 This event is complimentary and reserved for members\, plus one guest. We 
 kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to the s
 tart of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/211942
CATEGORIES:The Arts
END:VEVENT
